title The leaves that sing, and the eight roots under twelve refusals
prompt Continue the loop -- close the season family's twelve leaf roots, roster the room, lower the reach ceiling
think Opened by pulling xykj61 first per the sync rota; already up to date at f85777f034. Cold roster launched before reading anything, tree_at_open=048537bc345a.
think N = git rev-list --count HEAD = 3463, so rota row 3 -- Water/Venus, care and flow. Read all three: the shape you grew and the shape you are, the happy zone and the thin edge, growing a language. The middle one landed on the work: 111 of 144 equinox rungs chain an elder and each re-runs the chain beneath it, which is an integrated test, and the 33 leaves are the isolated checks. Singing leaves rather than chains is Rainsberger's multiplication-into-addition, arriving in a room that had never heard of it.
think Ran the 33 leaves cold and got exactly the 12 the handoff named. Then refused to fix any of them until every root was mapped, because a symptom fixed is a root that moves.
think Eight roots under twelve refusals, and only two were the stale-citation shape the last lap predicted. e132/e133/e134/e135 all resolve to ONE root, the 17-vs-25 date-label census, through two chains.
think e121 and e122 are mutually unsatisfiable, three separate ways. e121 requires the Lexicon roots row to name `the Framework itself` and `a counsel container in the cloud`; e122's scan REFUSES on exactly those. e121 requires `holds a raise`; e122 refuses it. e121 requires `Name the root when a measurement is reported`; e122 seated the exact inverse -- a measurement comes from a Bench, never from a root. Twenty-five days, and neither could ever be green while the other was.
think e129 is a real code bug in two halves. equinox_bundle_manifest.sh computes SHA3_ROOT as dirname/../.. which from tools/gen/season/ lands on tools/, then asks for $SHA3_ROOT/tools/fixtures/sha3.sh -- tools/tools/. And RC=$? on the next line is dead: under set -e, X=$(cmd) takes the assignment's own status, so the shell exits before the `bundle_sha3 unavailable` branch can print. Proved that from both sides in a one-line shell before believing it.
think e136 is the sharpest sweep interaction. The 20260823.101837 name-return rewrote Keaton Livermore to Keaton Dunsford across 35 living references and correctly left 28 dated files alone. The scan is living so it was swept; the pitch it reads is testimony so it was not. The sweep was right twice and left a guard demanding a name its subject can never say.
think e113 refused an IMPROVEMENT -- fascia health measured 44 against a pin of 41-or-42. A guard written to protect a number was refusing the tree for getting healthier.
think Then the loom. reds_ledger_monotone_scan.sh with no arguments defaults to the living pin alone, which since the first fold holds a suffix -- 3 rows against 232 -- so it answers not_monotone over a whole ledger. FOURTEEN tools/fixtures/equinox_*_scan.sh files call it bare. %231 repaired this exact shape a lap earlier for reds_row_present across 19 sites and left the sibling function untouched. Fixed the tool's default rather than fourteen callers; one edit, and every caller yet to be written.
think Seated the leaf choir at cadence tier -- discovered by rule, never listed, so a leaf born tomorrow sings on the lap it lands. Measured the cost honestly rather than carrying the handoff's number forward: 436 s for 33, not the 96 the last lap recorded, and e134 alone is 118 because it reaches ten more witnesses through instrument_suite_scan.sh. Corrected the number in the file's own comment before it shipped.
think Restructured prove-red to sing the plant alone after measuring that the witness would otherwise pay for the room twice -- 15 minutes for a cadence guard to prove a catch the second pass does not touch.
obs The first reach-meter fix over-claimed and I caught it by reading the number rather than trusting it: unreached fell 1,201 -> 959 on a change that rostered one guard, which is too large a fall for one row. The glob selects 144 equinox witnesses; the choir sings the 33 that chain nobody. Inferring reach would have called 111 refusing-or-unrun witnesses reached. Replaced inference with a declared `# reach-list:` enumerator the meter RUNS -- exact, opt-in, and it changes in the same edit the sing changes, because both read one list. Honest fall: 1,201 -> 1,154.
obs Owned in my own hand, and it cost the lap its clean cold open. I copied the whole repository into TMPDIR to test a string replacement while the cold roster was 52 guards into its 64. The copy filled the 3.9 GB tmpfs and the last four guards -- caravan_suite, ales_roster, reds_ledger_headline, reds_row_present -- answered red on ENOSPC. The card says hold still while it runs; a pen is motion. All four re-proved GREEN by hand on the same unmoved tree (digest 048537bc345a at open and close), and the authoritative reading for this round is the hot roster over the tree the commit ships. Booked as %239 rather than waved off as a machine fact, because it arrived wearing a tree red's clothes and the runner has no reading that tells them apart. The replacements each assert their own match count and refuse rather than misfire, which was the check actually wanted -- a repo-sized pen was never the cheap way to get it.
obs The ledger headline caught me too, and that is the guard working. Booking seven rows moved the spine to 239 while the published headline still read 232; reds_ledger_monotone_witness refuses that disagreement by design. Folded %231-%232 to a shelf to get the pin under 24,576, deepened all four relative links by hand and resolved every one of the five from the shelf's own directory -- %183's fault, in the room whose repair note says this shelf has no generator. Kept %230 flat on purpose: it is OPEN and gated, and folding an open gate hides it.
obs Twelve closes, and only two were what the handoff expected. The other six roots were a contradiction, a path bug, a dead set -e branch, a pinned census refusing improvement, a fused pointer, and a gitignored build artifact. A room nobody hears does not merely go stale -- it drifts in every direction at once, and the drifts disagree with each other.
